			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct ApplicationState import paths in Extension module\n\nUpdate the import statements in `Source/Binary/Extension/ExtensionPopulate.rs` and `ScanPathConfigure.rs` to resolve the `ApplicationState` type via the new nested path `ApplicationState::State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState`.\n\nAlign with the recent refactoring of the `ApplicationState` module, which reduced the root module to an atomic placeholder and shifted type definitions to granular sub-modules. This ensures the Extension logic correctly resolves the `ApplicationState` struct and `MapLockError` type, preventing compilation failures caused by the legacy flat import path.",
